{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0\u25bc BOSS-RUSH</strong>\u00a0<strong>on Stage</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/0928d0780bc2cb8754d6bc8215c0376e.poster.avif?t=1770307068\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/0928d0780bc2cb8754d6bc8215c0376e.webm?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/0928d0780bc2cb8754d6bc8215c0376e.mp4?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katuba\u2019s Poacher</strong> is a Boss-Rush Action game where every battle feels like a show.<br><i>Dodge, strike, and move in sync with chaos. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0\u25bc ORIGINAL MUSIC per boss</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/9401906d41dfdf1ba53b5a7190b44ab7.poster.avif?t=1770307068\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/9401906d41dfdf1ba53b5a7190b44ab7.webm?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/9401906d41dfdf1ba53b5a7190b44ab7.mp4?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn't a rhythm game,</strong><br>but every boss attacks in time with their own theme,<br>turning each fight into a tightly choreographed showdown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0\u25bc Bold, Animated Visuals</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/128f7c7ef4a271aea99f354d11e29eda.poster.avif?t=1770307068\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/128f7c7ef4a271aea99f354d11e29eda.webm?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/128f7c7ef4a271aea99f354d11e29eda.mp4?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant cartoon-style art and quirky characters bring the world to life.<br>Each loop pushes you to react faster, hit harder, and dive deeper into its absurd world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>\u25bc Collect trophies. Craft weapons.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/2854441054a78ab4e37ccf081c44c022.poster.avif?t=1770307068\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/2854441054a78ab4e37ccf081c44c022.webm?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/2854441054a78ab4e37ccf081c44c022.mp4?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn hunted parts into new weapons. <br>Unlock skills, gain traits and get ready for the next hunt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>\u00a0\u25bc Hunt or Be Hunted : A World of Chaos, Comedy, and Bounty</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/26e5ef15934b3c5bc52365f14fb4cdd9.poster.avif?t=1770307068\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/26e5ef15934b3c5bc52365f14fb4cdd9.webm?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/extras/26e5ef15934b3c5bc52365f14fb4cdd9.mp4?t=1770307068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track monsters through chaotic maps or run before bounty hunters take your head. <br><i><strong>You were once the poacher... now you're the prey.</strong></i><br><br><i><strong>- Why are you hunting Sharp? And why is everyone suddenly after you? </strong></i><br> <br>Join a wild chase to capture the bounty on the adorable monster &quot;Sharp&quot; in a world full of chaos, comedy, and creative twists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bc Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bold cartoon visuals and\u00a0comedy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Boss-rush combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills. Traits. Weapons from what you hunt.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track monsters  or get hunted yourself</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2488500?t=1770307068","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770307068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/fed625b5f27487a8b49ba6582686d6f519f8f78e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770307068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488500/fed625b5f27487a8b49ba6582686d6f519f8f78e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770307068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficu